0:00:11.559,0:00:15.464
Would you believe my world was once all grey

0:00:15.464,0:00:17.364
I had almost given up hope

0:00:17.364,0:00:22.929
of ever finding someone who fits my shadow

0:00:24.029,0:00:26.029
Until

0:00:26.119,0:00:31.800
the word "us" was born

0:00:31.800,0:00:35.460
Thank you for seeing more than the surface

0:00:35.460,0:00:40.659
and always telling me you love who I am

0:00:40.659,0:00:45.491
On the days I lost heart, when the road ahead was unclear

0:00:45.491,0:00:49.124
whenever I turned around, I'd see

0:00:49.124,0:00:51.757
that you were always right beside me

0:00:51.757,0:00:53.056
Do you know

0:00:53.056,0:00:57.089
that you are the most special one to me

0:00:57.089,0:00:59.055
the exception to every rule

0:00:59.055,0:01:02.021
whatever it may be

0:01:02.021,0:01:07.320
From someone who never gave in to anyone

0:01:07.320,0:01:09.087
but whenever it comes to you

0:01:09.087,0:01:13.619
you're the only one I want to give in to

0:01:13.640,0:01:16.085
Your love

0:01:16.085,0:01:22.184
makes me want to be a better man

0:01:22.200,0:01:25.917
Every day I wake

0:01:25.917,0:01:28.083
I want to make you proud

0:01:28.083,0:01:31.915
From this day on

0:01:31.915,0:01:36.181
however hard the road ahead may be

0:01:36.181,0:01:39.980
I want you to be sure

0:01:39.980,0:01:44.313
that we'll hold hands and make it through together

0:01:44.313,0:01:47.012
never letting go

0:01:47.012,0:01:53.711
Let me be the one who takes care of you, forever

0:01:54.677,0:01:57.119
Every time I look at you, do you know what I see?

0:01:57.119,0:01:59.643
Our home one day, and you standing in the kitchen

0:01:59.643,0:02:02.109
Our kids running all through the garden we planned

0:02:02.109,0:02:04.775
I'll take you everywhere you've ever dreamed of

0:02:04.775,0:02:07.475
Hand in hand, I'll walk with you till we grow old together

0:02:07.475,0:02:10.208
I want to string together all the words I've saved for so long

0:02:10.208,0:02:12.774
and keep every feeling our hearts hold for each other

0:02:12.774,0:02:15.173
but the harder I try, the more it runs away with me

0:02:15.173,0:02:20.472
because how lovely you are is beyond words

0:02:20.472,0:02:25.238
So let me keep it simple and end on this last line

0:02:26.038,0:02:27.871
So many words, all meaning I love you

0:02:28.837,0:02:31.170
Your love

0:02:31.170,0:02:35.936
makes me want to be a better man

0:02:37.280,0:02:41.135
Every day I wake

0:02:41.135,0:02:43.634
I want to make you proud

0:02:43.634,0:02:47.100
From this day on

0:02:47.800,0:02:51.299
however hard the road ahead may be

0:02:52.033,0:02:55.099
I want you to be sure

0:02:55.099,0:02:59.898
that we'll hold hands and make it through together

0:02:59.898,0:03:02.564
never letting go

0:03:02.564,0:03:09.029
Let me be the one who takes care of you, forever

0:03:09.396,0:03:19.400
The rest of my life, I want to spend it with you
